0 // The curved bottom edge has stud cut-outs 4.8 LDU deep. Only the two at the front centre grip a stud
0 // firmly (the edge wraps most of the way round them), so those are the ones it snaps by. The cut-outs
0 // further round the curve hold too little, and offering them made it snap in the wrong places.
0 !LDCAD SNAP_CYL [gender=F] [caps=one] [secs=R 6 4] [pos=-10 0 0]
0 !LDCAD SNAP_CYL [gender=F] [caps=one] [secs=R 6 4] [pos=10 0 0]
